### Current user -> 200 (check: no "password" field in the response)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{annaToken}}

### Fake token -> 401
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer abc.def.ghi

### Validate token -> 200 "Valid token"
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/validate
Authorization: Bearer {{annaToken}}

### Validate fake token -> 401
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/validate
Authorization: Bearer abc.def.ghi
